{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"樂施毅行者首辦20公里賽事\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-21-09-11-07GGuO9r0t.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】樂施毅行者首度舉辦20公里賽事。</p><p>一眾跑手在起點大帽山扶輪公園熱身做準備。漁農自然護理署署長黎堅明、立法會議員姚柏良、陳家珮、藝人周潤發等出席起跑禮，他們亦有參與20公里賽事。</p><p>參加者要四人一隊，於8小時內走抵達終點屯門哈羅香港國際學校。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T02:03:57.733159+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T01:09:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:57:31.879191+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T01:57:32.015927+00:00","content_hash":"87db6020941eb66438fa74531d8dee4e5526b864b5fe092bbfd3c187cd2af5d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}